              </div>
              <div style="padding:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;">
                <p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--grey2);line-height:1.75;">Design and development of DC fast-charging solutions for electric vehicles, focusing on power electronics, Battery Management Systems (BMS), and smart grid integration.</p>
                <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;">
                  <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--grey2);"><span style="color:var(--cyan);flex-shrink:0;">▸</span>DC fast-charger hardware design &amp; power electronics</div>
                  <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--grey2);"><span style="color:var(--cyan);flex-shrink:0;">▸</span>Battery Management System (BMS) integration</div>
                  <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--grey2);"><span style="color:var(--cyan);flex-shrink:0;">▸</span>Smart grid communication &amp; load balancing</div>
                  <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--grey2);"><span style="color:var(--cyan);flex-shrink:0;">▸</span>AI-based predictive charging optimisation</div>
                </div>
                <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
                  <span style="background:rgba(0,180,216,.08);color:var(--cyan2);font-size:11px;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:6px;">Power Electronics</span>
                  <span style="background:rgba(0,180,216,.08);color:var(--cyan2);font-size:11px;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:6px;">BMS</span>
                  <span style="background:rgba(0,180,216,.08);color:var(--cyan2);font-size:11px;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:6px;">Smart Grid</span>
                  <span style="background:rgba(34,197,94,.08);color:#86efac;font-size:11px;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:6px;">EV / Green Tech</span>
